# Frontend

Next.js must not implement `/slots`, `/bookings`, or `/reset`. Call the backend at `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE` with `fetch`. Validate forms with shared Zod for UX; the API still decides. Keep the UI responsive and labelled. User-facing copy is polite clinic English; map spec API error strings in `lib/errors.ts` — do not change the API messages.
